<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Soundscapes of Alaska — an unofficial showcase of NPS Alaska acoustic monitoring highlights.">
  <h1>About Soundscapes of Alaska</h1>

  <h2>About This Site</h2>
  <p>
    This site was created to showcase soundscapes from across
    National Parks in the <a href="https://www.nps.gov/state/ak/index.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Alaska Region</a>.
    Raw audio was collected as part of National Park Service <a href="https://www.nps.gov/orgs/1050/index.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Natural Sounds and Night Skies Division</a> 
    (NSNSD) Type 1 acoustic monitoring data. Specific clips were then manually selected and edited.
  </p>

